  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "把你的本子弄脏了  (I Got Your Notebook Dirty)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "ji_xiu": "吉秀"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At lunchtime, Ji Xiu drops by Xingtian to eat with Bu Xiaogu. In the hallway she \"accidentally\" spills on Xiaogu's notebook — and steals a quick look at the notes inside. Listen first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总，你在哪儿啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是布小谷，我带您出去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "好啊，我在这儿呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "小谷，对不起啊，把你的本子都弄脏了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，没关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "见什么都要看看，不好意思啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，那我带您去吃饭。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "打扰了，那我先告辞了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through each line of their lunchtime encounter.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总，你在哪儿啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'President Ji, where are you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是布小谷，我带您出去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is Bu Xiaogu; I will take you out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "好啊，我在这儿呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Great — I am right over here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "小谷，对不起啊，把你的本子都弄脏了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, I am so sorry — I got your notebook all dirty.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，没关系。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is fine, it does not matter.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "见什么都要看看，不好意思啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whatever I see, I cannot help taking a look — sorry about that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，那我带您去吃饭。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No worries — then let me take you to eat.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "打扰了，那我先告辞了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry for the intrusion — I will take my leave first.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "吉总，你在哪儿啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我是布小谷，我带您出去。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "好啊，我在这儿呢。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "小谷，对不起啊，把你的本子都弄脏了。",
      "gap": 0.5
