    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，没关系。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "见什么都要看看，不好意思啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "没事，那我带您去吃饭。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "打扰了，那我先告辞了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Xiaogu thinks nothing of the spill — not realising Ji Xiu has seen her notes. You learned the apology pair \"duibuqi\" and \"mei guanxi\", plus \"chifan\" and polite \"darao le\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
